<p>Former Brazilian intelligence chief Alexandre Ramagem has been detained by US Immigration and Customs Enforcement in the United States, several outlets reported. His arrest brings a fugitive former senior Brazilian official into US custody. Brazilian authorities want him over a failed scheme to overturn President Luiz Inacio Lula da Silva’s election victory and block him from taking office. Brazil is seeking Ramagem’s return through extradition, so the focus now shifts to what US authorities do next with a former official already in immigration detention.</p><img src='https://kagiproxy.com/img/8jYB8-pTTcFaOwnBQzPffwaVVep3ITeiaz0hSKTORMVldeEbeII-mytbCk86qA18lYrG2rp5X5G7pcfOclYgu7qLOiC50k4uVlXPaz5UJy-S8JCfLX0nKpR83l28ONnYbM-jtDRdtDunw26KqGyWUWJ3A9P9M91BfWzW93v14fv8rqrZCA' alt='Former Brazilian President Jair Bolsonaro (left) and former intelligence chief Alexandre Ramagem cheer at a rally in Rio de Janeiro on July 18, 2024.' /><br /><h3>Highlights:</h3><ul><li>Escape route: The Guardian reported that Ramagem left Brazil by car for Guyana days before the verdict, then boarded a flight to the United States, avoiding immediate arrest after the ruling.</li><li>Asylum push: ABC reported that a Brazilian senator publicly urged the United States to grant Ramagem political asylum after ICE arrested him.</li></ul><h3>Sources:</h3><ul><li><a href='https://www.scmp.com/news/world/americas/article/3349961/brazils-fugitive-ex-spy-chief-detained-ice-us'>Former Brazil spy chief arrested by ICE in Florida</a> - scmp.com</li><li><a href='https://www.dw.com/en/us-fugitive-brazilian-ex-spy-chief-arrested-by-ice/a-76769371'>US: Fugitive Brazilian ex-spy chief arrested by ICE</a> - dw.com</li><li><a href='https://www.lemonde.fr/en/international/article/2026/04/14/fugitive-former-brazilian-intelligence-chief-detained-by-us-immigration_6752384_4.html'>Fugitive former Brazilian intelligence chief detained by US immigration</a> - lemonde.fr</li><li><a href='https://www.theguardian.com/worl